## Research Outcomes

This project establishes a unified probabilistic framework for solving inverse problems in computational science and engineering. By combining Bayesian inference, deep generative models, and uncertainty quantification, the research aims to enable reliable parameter estimation, uncertainty-aware prediction, and accelerated scientific discovery. The methodologies developed are applicable to computational mechanics, fluid dynamics, materials science, geophysics, and other domains requiring trustworthy Scientific Machine Learning.

